{
  "name": "AKU faculty, students celebrate World Blood Donor Day",
  "parent_id": 203313787796667,
  "group_id": "51bec2b8-8ecf-43a7-a30d-6bf0c6484656",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-30T15:29:11.538Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:03:50.495Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:03:50.482Z",
  "id": 203717638332880,
  "uuid": "648692df-62ef-4404-b1a9-b3ffeaba0c6b",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "558c3138-f4b4-dc38-af1b-36e9e02b39a1",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9e6e0340-51e1-5360-47b1-c4798fd90c0e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The event served to raise awareness of the need for regular blood donations so that communities have access to affordable timely supply of safe blood.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"The real spirit of World Blood Donor day rests with the donors who don't ask for compensation and donate voluntarily,\" said Natasha Ali, Associate Professor and Section Head Haematology and Transfusion Medicine.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The event was attended by over 200 participants, including chairman Karachi Lions AKUH Blood Bank Committee, Anwar Ajanee, blood bank staff, faculty, residents and students. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"There is a lot of physical and emotional labour that goes in blood donation but looking at the enthusiasm of donors on this day is very heartwarming and makes one realise that the struggle must continue,\" said Sejal Atta Gondal of Falah, AKU's student organisation. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
