    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The faculty and students of the Aga Khan University Medical College celebrated World Blood Donor Day here on June 15, 2019. The event was held by the Haematology and Transfusion Medicine section of the Department of Pathology and Laboratory Medicine. The theme for this year's event was \"By Donating Blood, you can Save Lives,\" and was held to educate the community about the importance of donating blood.",
